 rotate slowly, water filling in as the clothes tumble. A warm female voice with a gentle, reassuring tone (S1) says in an off-screen voiceover: <d>[Chinese] 深层洁净，轻松去渍。</d> while no character's lips are visible on screen.\n\n[Shot 2] At 00:02.500, the camera cuts to a bright sunlit balcony. Freshly washed clothes hang neatly on a clothesline — crisp white shirts, vibrant colored garments that look bright and color-protected — gently swaying in the breeze. Sunlight filters through the fabric, giving everything a soft, clean glow. The same warm female voice (S1) continues in an off-screen voiceover: <d>[Chinese] 护色鲜亮，衣物如新。</d> while no character's lips are visible on screen.\n\n[Shot 3] At 00:05.000, the shot transitions to a macro close-up against a clean white background. The cream-white laundry detergent bottle tilts, and a stream of silky, pearl-white liquid pours smoothly from the spout in a graceful arc, catching the light with a luminous, viscous quality. Delicate, fragrant-looking mist particles float around the stream. The same warm female voice (S1) continues in an off-screen voiceover: <d>[Chinese] 进口香氛精油，持久留香。</d> while no character's lips are visible on screen.\n\n[Shot 4] At 00:07.500, the pouring liquid transforms into a shimmering particle effect — countless glowing white and golden sparkles swirl upward and coalesce, assembling the full product bottle from particles in a magical reveal. The 2.5L cream-white bottle with its black ribbed screw cap materializes from the particles, rotating slowly to face front. As the particles settle, the label details come into sharp focus: \"ESSENTIAL OIL Washing Liquid\" at the top, the red circular stamp reading \"进口原液\", the black silhouette of a mother holding a child's hand in the center, the Chinese product name \"COCO香 护色洁净香氛洗衣液\" with \"进口香氛精油\" and \"香水除螨 洁净无残留\" beneath it, the yellow-and-blue circular badge reading \"不含荧光剂\" at the bottom right, and \"NET: 2.5L\" at the bottom. Toward the end, the bottle settles into a perfectly centered front-facing position against a pure white background, matching the exact angle, lighting, label placement, silhouette position, handle visibility, and final composition established by <Picture 1>. The same warm female voice (S1) concludes in an off-screen voiceover: <d>[Chinese] 香水除螨，洁净无残留。</d> while no character's lips are visible on screen.\n\noverall_soundscape: The washing machine drum rumbles softly with water sloshing inside. Gentle breeze and distant birdsong accompany the balcony scene. The pour produces a smooth, viscous liquid sound with soft sparkling accents. The particle effect carries a shimmering, magical whoosh sound that resolves into clean, airy studio ambience.\n\nnon_diegetic_music: A warm, uplifting piano melody at a moderate tempo with soft strings, building gently through the first two shots. The music brightens with light chimes during the pour shot, then swells into a fuller, more elegant arrangement with a magical, sparkling quality for the particle reveal, holding a warm and satisfying tone at the final product frame."], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "type": "JjkText", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [413.20001220703125, 344.6499938964844], "pos": [963.3773193359375, 1237.40380859375], "id": 11, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "JjkText"}, "order": 11}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "STRING", "label": "STRING", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "STRING"}], "size": [486.2100830078125, 271.4978332519531], "pos": [948.3421630859375, 2036.4859619140625], "widgets_values": [], "inputs": [{"name": "source", "link": 29, "label": "source", "type": "*", "localized_name": "source"}], "flags": {}, "id": 27, "type": "PreviewAny", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "PreviewAny"}, "order": 20}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["联系